[1m[38;5;231mHow long should the stored identifier survive?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mlocalStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mSurvives restarts and is shared across tabs. Needs an explicit clear() on logout so shared machines don't retain [39m
     [38;5;246mthe previous user.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m sessionStorage
     [38;5;246mPer-tab, auto-cleared on close. Safer on shared machines, but a second tab won't see the identity.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m In-memory only
     [38;5;246mNo storage at all; identity lives for the page's lifetime. Safest, but does not satisfy 'persist'.[39m
